@startuml
title Release with a manual gate
|Developer|
start
:Open pull request;
|CI|
:Build and test;
if (Tests green?) then (yes)
  :Deploy to staging;
else (no)
  |Developer|
  :Fix the build;
  stop
endif
|Release manager|
:Check staging;
while (Smoke tests pass?) is (no)
  :Roll back staging;
  |Developer|
  :Fix the bug;
  |Release manager|
endwhile (yes)
fork
  :Announce release;
fork again
  |CI|
  :Deploy to production;
end fork
|Release manager|
:Close the change;
stop
@enduml
